Determine and explain the functionality of the following code fragment and write the output of any
sample input
void funtion1(int a[], int n, int k)
{
k = k % n;
int temp[n];
for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)
temp[i] = a[(i + k) % n];
for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)
a[i] = temp[i];
}

Determine and explain the functionality of the following code fragment and write the output of any
sample input.
void Funtion1(int a[], int n)
{
for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i += 2)
{
int temp = a[i];
a[i] = a[i + 1];
a[i + 1] = temp;
}
}
